# Local dev: leave VITE_API_BASE unset. Vite's dev server proxies /v1, /health,
# /ws to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts) — nothing to configure.
#
# Deployed (e.g. Vercel): there is no dev proxy, so set this to the deployed
# API's public origin at build time. See team/SBU.md for the actual value.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://beacon-api.<region>.azurecontainerapps.io
